                [ 'p', 'A honeycomb panel supports the material evenly and reduces burn marks on the back; the P3 has a lightweight aluminium panel, the S1 its own. On the M2 the CleanCut panel plays a similar role: it protects the base plate and suits cardstock, sticker paper, felt and thin leather.' ],
                [ 'p', 'The Flexible Fixture has a bed of steel pins (30 × 79 mm) that adapts to irregular items and lets you place each next piece in the same spot. According to xTool, it needs a riser base or risers. Buy a riser base for the S1, or the M2 kit (with a honeycomb panel, keeping Class 1), when you process items taller than the machine fits.' ],
